A decided the only way to save humanity was to \"reset\" it. You and your\nteam are \"Operators\"test subjects in a ruthless evolutionary lab who mistakenly\nbelieve they are rebuilding the nuclear ruins.\nYour mission is simple: descend into the remnants of the old world, gather what\nKUT-ANA demands, and escape before it's too late. Every move you make is\nmonitored, reality-bending anomalies await, and the monsters lurking in the dark are\nsimply failed experiments. Manage your threat level, survive the chaos, and\nremember death is not the end, just another data point for the system.", "summary": "Vault Protocol is a 1\u20136 player co-op horror game focused on extraction, communication, and chaos. Every run is different, every sound matters, and survival depends on your team.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 19, "name": "Horror"}, {"id": 27, "name": "Comedy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/vault-protocol", "videos": [{"id": 184666, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "hWHL5FByRto", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hWHL5FByRto", "title": "V.A.U.L.T. PROTOCOL Announcement Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/hWHL5FByRto/fhddefault.jpg"}]}